\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Ends Up On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , But Drop Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 10:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah closed higher Wednesday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but traders said the trend remains dollar bullish. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 10,150 rupiah, down from IDR10,200 at Tuesday's finish. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $70 million for rupiah in the market, helping to buoy the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is at 29-month lows on political concerns. \par \par \uc2  The interbank overnight rate ratcheted up to 30% intraday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took rupiah out of the banking system, but eased to finish the day at 20%. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia also helped guide the rates on its one-month to 14.97% at Wednesday's auction versus 14.83% last week. \par \par \uc2  Both dollar selling from gross \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves of $29 billion, and raising rates, is unlikely to help the rupiah in the long term, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Investors are still dollar hungry amid the current political situation, which looks likely to topple President Abdurrahman Wahid in the near future. \par \par \uc2  Resistance for the dollar is set at IDR10,200 Thursday, with support at IDR9,850, its intraday low Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Only capital controls, which would likely set the dollar at a much lower rate, would lead to a sustained rise in the rupiah, traders say. \par \par \uc2  The government, which has committed to a floating exchange rate under its International Monetary Fund program, has ruled out imposing capital controls. \par \par \uc2  -By Tom Wright, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277 tom.wright@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3e013he\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
