\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Plans  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  In Interbank Money Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 03:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interbank money market later Monday to absorb rupiah liquidity, an official with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The pressure on the rupiah in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is expected to ease if its liquidity in the interbank money market is tightened. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official told Dow Jones Newswire that Bank Indonesia has checked with banks on the rates and the amount of the rupiah they are offering. \par \par \uc2  The official said Bank Indonesia hasn't yet decided how much rupiah it will absorb in the money market. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's move to check rates in the money market has boosted the overnight interbank rate on the rupiah to 30% from 13.5%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia has said several times that it would tighten rupiah liquidity to ease pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The rupiah fell to a 30-month low of IDR11,500 to the U.S. dollar Monday amid growing concerns about political conflicts in the country. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was trading at IDR10,313 at 0245 GMT (9:45 a.m. EST Monday), up from its close at IDR10,500 Monday thanks to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made Sentana,Dow Jones Newswires;62-21 39831277\par I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com\par -0- 13/03/01 02-53G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3d014jv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
