\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Governor: May  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  Tue To Help Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 02:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  further Tuesday to help the ailing rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "If necessary, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more," Sjahril told reporters late Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah closed nearly 4% lower Monday from Friday as political\par unrest continued to fuel active dollar buying. The local unit touched a\par 30-month low of 11,500 to the dollar Monday before the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par - - 13/03/01 01-14G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sjahril said Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  officials will meet Senior Economics\par Minister Rizal Ramli at 0300 GMT (10:00 p.m. EST Monday) to discuss ways\par of boosting the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is willing to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  more to help the\par rupiah but it won't impose capital controls.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It seems hard to reach the 7,000 level, but if the rupiah can\par strengthen to less than 10,000 that's positive," Sjahril said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said they believed the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spent between $50 million\par to $60 million to defend the rupiah Monday, either by selling dollars\par indirectly through state banks or directly in the foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277;\par farida.husna@dowjones.com\par -0- 13/03/01 01-26G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3d014go\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
