\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah breaches 11,000 as worries grow. \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 05:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, March 12 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah slid past 11,000 per dollar on Monday, extending early losses after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had limited ability to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor Anwar Nasution's comments that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  now would be like "pouring water into the sand" drove the rupiah past its earlier low of 10,800. \par \par \uc2  "All this time Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has raised interest rates, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the rupiah keeps weakening...political reconciliation is a must to gain stability," he said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was quoted at 11,100/400 at 0356 GMT, down 10.1 percent from its late Friday levels. It has not broken past 11,000 since September 24, 1998. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said doubts over President Abdurrahman Wahid's leadership and his ability to handle economic and ethnic problems had spurred dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  News that thousands of anti-and pro-government protesters had poured onto the streets of Jakarta also unnerved the market. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia and state banks were the only sellers of dollars in a thin market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Companies and banks are busy covering their short dollar positions while there are few offerers of dollars. It could go to 15,000 before we see any profit-taking on the dollar," said a dealer at a foreign bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  "Bank Indonesia sold a small amount of dollars this morning and stopped. I don't think they can do much at this point," she said. \par \par \uc2  "The fall was exaggerated a bit by thin volume. I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent rules to curb speculation have backfired," she added, referring to the drying up of liquidity following BI's new \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading curbs. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx3c0439t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
