\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends 4% Down But Off 30-Mo Lows \b0\par\par\uc2 506 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 10:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah closed nearly 4% lower Monday from Friday as political unrest continued fueling active dollar buying, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, ended the session off the 30-month low of IDR11,500 it fell to earlier in the day due to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they believed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent between $50 million and $60 million to defend the rupiah Monday, either by selling dollars indirectly through state banks or directly in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at IDR10,500 Monday, up from its close at IDR10,100 Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market got nervous as thousands of students protested outside the presidential palace demanding President Abdurrahman Wahid's resignation and the cancelation of a proposal to increase fuel prices April 1. \par \par \uc2  Despite the protest, Wahid told a news conference that he won't resign. The government, however, decided to delay the planned fuel price increase until October at the earliest. It will only increase fuel prices for large industrial users, it added. \par \par \uc2  The market welcomed the government's decision to delay the fuel price increase as such a move is expected to reduce social unrest. \par \par \uc2  "It's the best political decision to make regarding the current unstable social-political conditions," said a dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  Besides \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  also raised its overnight money market rate by 50 basis points to 12.125%. Such a move would encourage banks to park their rupiah with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  instead of use them to buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  Many banks, however, held onto their rupiah as they expect active dollar buying in the spot market will boost demand for the rupiah in the interbank money market in coming days, thus enabling them to earn even higher returns. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the rupiah's plunge dragged Indonesian share prices 4.2% lower Monday. \par \par \uc2  Despite the rupiah rebounding off IDR11,500, dealers say the bullish sentiment toward the dollar is still intact as the country's political problems persist. \par \par \uc2  The market also knows that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  is limited as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has only gross \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves around $29 billion, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Senior Deputy Governor Anwar Nasution admitted Monday that Bank Indonesia's capability to help the rupiah is limited as the rupiah's weakness is due mainly to political factors. \par \par \uc2  Senior Economic Minister Rizal Ramli also said that the government isn't considering capital controls to help the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Barring new political developments, dealers expect the dollar to trade in a wide range of between IDR10,200 and IDR11,000 Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277 I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (Corrected 1037GMT) \par \par \uc2  Besides \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  also raised its overnight rate by 50 basis points to 12.125%. \par \par \uc2  (In an item timed around 1026 GMT, the overnight rate was misstated.) \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3c012pe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
