\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Ready To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Help Rupiah -Governor \b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 06:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said Friday the bank would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah, but ruled out new measures to help the battered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We are always ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the rupiah, but there is no new policy," Sjahril Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's current policy is to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars when the rupiah is weak, but it doesn't announce this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a case-by-case basis. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril's comments suggest the bank won't consider other harsher measures - such as full capital controls - to restrict the rupiah's fall. \par \par \uc2  Earlier this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  banned offshore trading in rupiah, which has cut speculative activity, but it stopped short of banning the transfer of rupiah out of the country into dollars. \par \par \uc2  In afternoon trade, the dollar is at IDR10,050, much higher than IDR9,930 at Thursday's close in Asia. The rupiah is at its lowest levels since October 1998. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has plunged on the political and social chaos gripping the nation. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Tom Wright, Dow Jones Newswires; 6221 3983 1277;\par tom.wright@dowjones.com\par -0- 09/03/01 06-04G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx39010za\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
