\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Gov: Will  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  If IDR Below 10,000/Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 10:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank Indonesia drew a line of defense for the rupiah at IDR10,000 to the dollar, with the governor saying Tuesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the local unit above that level. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will also raise interest rates if necessary to help the rupiah, which is currently at over two-year lows of at IDR9,880 to the dollar, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sjahril Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "Bank Indonesia will take action if the rupiah breaches IDR10,000 to the dollar support," Sjahril said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah through selling dollars, but it doesn't announce action on a daily basis. \par \par \uc2  Rates on the bank's one-month paper are currently at 14.79%, having risen sharply toward the end of last year to help the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah is low as political tensions and security concerns continue to deter foreign investors. \par \par \uc2  Critics say higher rates are unlikely to bring back foreign investors to rupiah assets, but are necessary to keep imported inflation in check. \par \par \uc2  They also question Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , given its lack of foreign reserves for a sustained defense of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Foreign reserves are currently around $29 billion on a gross basis. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Edhi Pranasidhi, Dow Jones Newswires; 6221 3983 1277;\par edhi.pranasidhi@dowjones.com\par -0- 06/03/01 09-28G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3600zlx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
