\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 : Will  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Help Rupiah If Necessary \b0\par\par\uc2 165 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 07:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor said Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah, which is currently at its lowest level in over two years. \par \par \uc2  "We will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary," Sjahril Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The dollar, which rose to IDR9,875 Friday afternoon, is its highest level since October 1998. \par \par \uc2  Political factors, including moves to impeach President Abdurrahman Wahid, and ethnic violence in Kalimantan are behind the rupiah's weakness, Sjahril said. \par \par \uc2  Still, the dollar would have risen even further, possibly through IDR10,000, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hadn't implemented new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulations earlier this year, Sjahril said. \par \par \uc2  In January, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  banned offshore trade in the rupiah, effectively ending speculation in the forward market. The step fell short of full capital controls, as investors can still freely move rupiah into dollars offshore. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 6221 3983 1277; farida.husna@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3200xnn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
