\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Dep Gov: No  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  After Bomb \b0\par\par\uc2 177 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2000\par 06:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday it won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah after a bomb exploded in the stock exchange Wednesday, sending the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower. \par \par \uc2  Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom said the dollar was likely to rise further as investors continue to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the blast, which left 15 dead and dozens injured. \par \par \uc2  Dollar strength against regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also helping to push the rupiah lower, she said. \par \par \uc2  In midmorning trade, the dollar was at 8,640 rupiah, off a morning high of IDR8,890. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that state-banks sold dollars around IDR8,890 driving the U.S. unit lower. Dealers believed that state-banks acted on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia sometimes sells dollars in the market in small amounts when the market is short of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, it didn't call it an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which it defines as selling dollars in large amounts. \par \par \uc2  -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 3983 1277 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw9e04gos\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
