\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends At 16-Mo Low After Tue Bomb Blast \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 2000\par 13:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah ended at a 16-month low Wednesday amid continuing jitters after a bomb blast ripped through the Attorney General's office late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  After rising to an intraday high of IDR9,445, the dollar closed Wednesday at IDR9,395, up from IDR8,956 late Tuesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the explosion at the Attorney General's office late Tuesday sparked a surge in dollar buying. Pressure on the rupiah could lift the dollar as high as IDR9,600 Thursday, one foreign dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The bomb exploded just after investigators had finished questioning former President Suharto's youngest son Hutomo "Tommy" Mandala Putra over alleged corruption. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was further hurt Wednesday after police found another unexploded bomb at the Attorney General's office. The state prosecutor's complex was evacuated and cordoned off by police as a bomb squad removed the device. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  must \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah to bring the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under control. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday raised interest rates on one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes for the ninth consecutive week, but this move has previously failed to stop the rupiah's slide. \par \par \uc2  "They have been raised a few times already and it's not helping at all," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He said some state banks were buying rupiah to try and support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it was ineffective. \par \par \uc2  "The demand for dollars was just too overwhelming," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect a range of IDR9,300-9,600 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By Leigh Murray, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; leigh.murray@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw7503a0c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
