\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  Selectively To Stabilise IDR \b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 2000\par 11:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Wednesday it will maintain the free float system for the rupiah while continuing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  selectively on a limited basis to maintain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stability. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah exchange rate will be left to the market, it said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statement said efforts will be taken "to maintain the rupiah's stability...in the foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in a limited and selective manner." \par \par \uc2  The statement said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to maintain its net international reserves in line with the government's target. \par \par \uc2  Political friction between President Abdurrahman Wahid and the parliament fueled by conflicting comments by Wahid on police investigations into suspected corruption and riot-inciting by lawmakers has sent the rupiah crashing 7% since Friday. \par \par \uc2  At 1019 GMT, the dollar was trading at IDR9,395, up from IDR8,975 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Confusion over the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strategy to defend the rupiah also weighed on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In its statement, Bank Indonesia said it expects the Indonesian economy to grow by between 3% and 4% during the third quarter of 2000. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; 62 21 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \u