\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Deputy Gov:Won't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Help Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 378 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 2000\par 08:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom said Wednesday that the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to help the rupiah as such a move won't help the ailing local unit. \par \par \uc2  "We are not going to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Miranda told journalists on a sidelines of a seminar. \par \par \uc2  "We still see that the rupiah's weakness is only temporary," she added \par \par \uc2  Miranda's statement contradicts acting governor Anwar Nasution's statement Tuesday that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah and "the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't give up in helping the rupiah." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said earlier Wednesday that Bank Indonesia was heard selling the dollar through state banks to defend the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (Corrected 0939GMT) \par \par \uc2  The rupiah has lost 5.4% of its value over the last three days on concerns about mounting political tension in the run-up of the August parliamentary session. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at IDR9,195 at 0735 GMT, up from IDR8,960 late Tuesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia has allowed the rate of it's one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes to rise over the last seven weeks due to the persistent rupiah's weakness. \par \par \uc2  The average rate of the note was 12.33% after a weekly auction last week. \par \par \uc2  Miranda said she expects banks won't demand a sharp increase in the SBI rate through a weekly auction, as a sharp increase on the benchmark rate will push other domestic interest rates up sharply. \par \par \uc2  "(A) sharp rise on domestic interest rates will hurt (the) economic recovery," Miranda said. \par \par \uc2  She added that the rupiah current weakness was due to political uncertainties. \par \par \uc2  "(The) domestic political situation is getting more and more uncertain," she said. "Under such circumstances the rupiah will be affected (weaken)." \par \par \uc2  She added that the rupiah weakness will boost inflationary pressures. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana,Dow Jones Newswires 62 21 3983 1277; I-Made.Sentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom said Wednesday that the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to help the rupiah as such a move won't help the ailing local unit. \par \par \uc2  (An item that ran at 0704 GMT misstated the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw75039mw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
