\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  says  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  on rupiah. \b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juli 2000\par 10:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, July 4 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  engaged in minor \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the battered rupiah, acting bank governor Anwar Nasution said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Nasution repeated comments he made last week that the rupiah would become more stable after a key meeting in August of the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR), which will hear an account of President Abdurrahman Wahid's first turbulent year in office. \par \par \uc2  "The (rupiah) fluctuation is temporary," Nasution told reporters, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was only small. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah has flirted with 9,000 to the U.S. dollar in the past two days on concerns over Indonesia's political stability. By 0845 GMT it was being quoted at 8,948/8,963, its lowest levels since March 1999. \par \par \uc2  Nasution gave no more details on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly converts millions of dollars in international loans into rupiah, a factor that has supported the beleaguered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past year. \par \par \uc2  He reiterated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would do what it could to support the rupiah, including using one-month benchmark SBI interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Those rates have been hiked in recent weeks, to above 12 percent last Wednesday, their highest level in six months. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah is trading far from the level of 7,000 to the dollar assumed in Indonesia's current budget. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Bambang Sudibyo said earlier on Tuesday the rupiah's fair value against the dollar, based on the country's economic fundamentals, was between 6,500 to 7,500. \par \par \uc2  Sudibyo said the government has no plan to revise the budget assumptions, however. ((Muklis Ali, Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364, Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw7402cb3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
