e rupiah," said Pardy Kendi, a director at Bank Buana Indonesia. "I would prefer to call it a smoothing \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 " in reaction to U.S. rate hikes, he added. \par \par \uc2  The one-month SBI rate stood at 11.13% last Wednesday, increasing by only a few basis points at weekly auctions since hitting a low of 10.88% April 26. \par \par \uc2  If the upward trend continues however, it would have a ripple effect on the budget, which already allocates a whopping 6.5% of gross domestic product to finance bank recapitalization. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I think they still have a small margin for increases of about 1 to\par 1.5 percentage points, but if the SBI goes higher than that, it would\par affect the budget," said Martin Panggabean, an economist at PT Bank\par Mandiri in Jakarta.\par -\par               Budget Concern\par -\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As of June 12, the government had issued 321.4 trillion rupiah\par ($1=IDR8,580) in recapitalization bonds and plans to issue another\par IDR105 trillion sometime this month.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Of the total, around two-fifths of the bonds pay interest linked to\par the SBI rates, or have floating rates, while the remainder carry a fixed\par coupon of 14%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Larger increases in interest rates would stretch government coffers,\par which are already relying on multilateral credit lines to fund this\par year's forecast budget deficit at 5% of gross domestic product.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "With increased interest rates, of course it would put more pressure\par on the government," said Pardy at Bank Buana.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But the government is downplaying the fact its hands are tied when it\par comes to financing a defense of the rupiah, and the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  this\par week appeared to signal to the market that it's comfortable with rising\par rates, despite the budget impact.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sjahril said Monday that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to boost the\par rupiah "every day." Although he gave few details, he said the SBI notes\par were the only real tool to stabilize the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , raising speculation\par that he was indicating rates would continue to creep up.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On Tuesday, senior economics minister Kwik Kian Gie lent some support\par to that view, arguing that rising rates would stem capital outflows and\par help the rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The interest rate increase is positive," Kwik told reporters. "People\par will put their money offshore if we don't increase rates domestically."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Such comments mark a departure from the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's position last\par month that it would only \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market if it felt its actions\par would have a positive effect on the rupiah. As the rupiah was sliding in\par May, market participants took the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  signals at the time to\par mean that Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  wouldn't seek to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market intent on pushing the rupiah down.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par While Sjahril's harder line signals Monday did lend some brief support\par to the rupiah - as well as the myriad fundamental reasons for rupiah\par weakness - most economists are taking the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  jawboning with a\par pinch of salt.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The rupiah is driven by something else, not interest rates,"\par Panggabean said, referring to negative foreign investor sentiment toward\par Indonesia.\par -\par            Systemwide Rate Hike Unlikely\par -\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The upward trend in rates hasn't yet hurt Indonesia's fragile\par recovery, but it could if it continues.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Interest rate hikes have failed to have a knock-on effect across the\par financial system, as bank lending and deposit rates are higher than Bank\par Indonesia rates.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The current increase on SBI rates won't necessarily lead to an\par increase in deposit and lending rates," Miranda Gultom, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par deputy governor, told reporters this week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It will drive these rates up only if the increase is drastic to an\par extent that banks have to compete with SBI to attract depositors," she\par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Currently, fixed deposit rates are between 12% and 14%, above the SBI\par rates. As depositors have to pay banks a fixed charge to invest in SBI\par notes, the spread is even higher than this.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But larger SBI rate hikes could start to attract depositors away from\par the banks, forcing upward deposit and lending rate adjustments.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With low rates crucial to help Indonesia's corporate debt\par restructuring efforts, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been keen to show it doesn't\par want to force such a situation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We will try to minimize the costs of interest rate hikes," Achjar\par Iljas, another deputy \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor, said this week, adding that\par other factors apart from rates were behind the rupiah's fall.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Tom Wright; 6221 3983 1277; tom.wright@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1184 4253 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw6e02wby\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
