\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Dozing ahead of US data, rupiah firms. \b0\par\par\uc2 996 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juni 2000\par 10:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, June 13 (Reuters) - Asian regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  drifted higher in late trade on Tuesday as players took \par \par \uc2  advantage of the dollar's recent gains. \par \par \uc2      The rupiah was bolstered by talk Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \par \par \uc2  prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shore up the ailing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      But trade was sluggish as investors lacked confidence and \par \par \uc2  willpower to chase the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  vigorously either way ahead \par \par \uc2  of U.S. data and Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan's \par \par \uc2  speech. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. is due to publish May retail sales data on Tuesday \par \par \uc2  and consumer price data on Wednesday. Greenspan is scheduled to \par \par \uc2  speak on business data analysis at 1710 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Investors are eyeing these events for clues on the Fed's \par \par \uc2  likely move on interest rates later this month. U.S. economists \par \par \uc2  polled by Reuters predicted on average the May retail sales \par \par \uc2  would be unchanged after a 0.2 percent decline in April. \par \par \uc2      A growing number of analysts now reckon Fed policymakers \par \par \uc2  are more likely to keep rates unchanged at the June meeting. \par \par \uc2      "Although many in the market do expect the dollar to lose \par \par \uc2  steam a bit in the medium-term, the rebound we see today is \par \par \uc2  just technical and linked to profit taking," said a senior \par \par \uc2  dealer at a major European bank. \par \par \uc2      "I don't think the dollar's bullish trend is reversing. \par \par \uc2  Buying dollars on dips is still the order of the day," he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The dollar retreated against the yen\tab   due to sporadic\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par selling interest from Japanese exporters at levels above 107.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yen. However, players lacked enough confidence in Japan's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par economic recovery to sell the dollar aggressively.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par INDONESIAN RUPIAH\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah strengthened as offshore players liquidated long\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar positions but it failed to break key resistance at 8,550\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par as corporate dollar demand capped the upside.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Comments by chief economics minister Kwik Kian Gie\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par supporting a rise in interest rates to halt an outflow of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par capital from the country failed to boost the rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Bank Indonesia has recently increased the key interest rate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on its one-month SBI certificates to prop up the ailing rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But the market remained sceptical about the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par capacity to shield the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  via higher interest rates or\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar buying \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the face of persistent worries\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par about the political outlook.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A continuing feud between \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Sjahril\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sabirin and President Abdurrahman Wahid was also keeping\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par investors edgy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par KOREAN WON -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The won was a touch weaker as local stock market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par consolidation provided little impetus to buy the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But despite its losses, it remained at the upper end of its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recent range.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     At 1,114.00, the dollar is already very close to oversold\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par territory, with a reading of 35.00 on the 14-day relative\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par strength index. A reading of 30 or below would indicate that it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par is oversold.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso slipped back toward the day's low of 42.46 after a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par brief rebound caused by dollar profit taking in early trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said some players were cutting long dollar/peso\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par positions in the non-deliverable forward market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     However, with the one-month premium dropping to around 68\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par centavos, a further sell-off is unlikely in the near-term, a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealer at a U.S. bank said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     On the political front, President Joseph Estrada was found\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to be in good health except for mildly high cholestoral levels\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and pre-existing gallstones.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Estrada, 63, underwent medical tests after he was seen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par grimacing in pain nd holding his right side during Independence\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Day celebrations on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     THAI BAHT\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The baht, which has been a popular proxy for the rupiah\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lately, gained some ground in sympathy with a rise in its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesian counterpart.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Technically, Bank of America said dollar/baht should hold\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at around 38.90-39.00 for now, ahead of a move up to test 39.20\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and then 39.40.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Separately, a survey of consumer confidence showed Thais\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par were less bullish about the overall economy in May than in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par previous six months due to higher oil prices and sustained weak\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par commodity prices.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The index for consumer confidence fell to 73.8 in May from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 79.4 in April.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     TAIWAN DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Taiwan dollar retained its soft tone, thanks to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par importer bids for the U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Its direction was seen hinged in the near-term on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par performance of local stocks which dealers said should continue\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to consolidate.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said the U.S. dollar's upside was seen capped at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 31.00 where heavy profit taking was expected to emerge.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Sing dollar edged up slightly, taking heart from a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recovery in the baht and the peso, but remained caught in a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par narrow range.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Most dealers were sidelined ahead of U.S. retail sales data\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and Fed Chairman Alan Greenspan's speech.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Support was pegged at 1.7270 and resistance at 1.7210, with\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a near-term forecast of a 1.7210-1.7240 range.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0824 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     106.48\tab  106.14\tab    -0.32\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7220\tab  1.7234\tab    +0.08\par  Taiwan dlr    30.801\tab  30.800\tab    -0.00\par  Korean won   1113.90\tab 1113.30\tab    -0.05\par  Baht\tab      38.92\tab   39.03\tab    +0.28\par  Peso\tab      42.41\tab   42.45\tab    +0.09\par  Rupiah\tab  8575.00\tab 8605.00\tab    +0.35\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     106.48\tab  102.21\tab    -4.01\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7220\tab  1.6640\tab    -3.37\par  Taiwan dlr    30.801\tab  31.380\tab    +1.88\par  Korean won   1113.90\tab 1135.00\tab    +1.89\par  Baht\tab      38.92\tab   37.45\tab    -3.78\par  Peso\tab      42.41\tab   40.20\tab    -5.21\par  Rupiah\tab  8575.00\tab 6975.00\tab   -18.66\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7997\tab    +0.01\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Desk (65) 870-3087\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par email:asia.\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 @reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6d03rbm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pich