\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Gov: To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In Market To Boost Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 2000\par 09:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin said Monday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in to boost the rupiah by selling dollars. \par \par \uc2  "If necessary, we are going to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market every day," Sjahril told to reporters before making a scheduled appearance before a parliamentary committee on the Bank Bali case. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril, however, declined to disclose the amount dollars that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to sell to strengthen the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0730 GMT (3:30 a.m. EDT), the dollar was trading at 8,630 rupiah, compared with IDR8,653 in late Asian trading Friday. The rupiah has weakened 18% since early January. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also plans to use the Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes to help boost the rupiah. The notes are auctioned by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  every Wednesday . \par \par \uc2  "So far, we only have this (the SBI notes) to help stabilize the rupiah," he added. \par \par \uc2  He didn't explain, however, whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise the interest rates on the SBI notes. \par \par \uc2  The rate on one-month SBI notes rose to 11.13% last Wednesday from 11.07% a weak earlier. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril, in the hearings session Monday, is expected to clarify to the members of the parliamentary committee on whether he was involved in the Bank Bali case. \par \par \uc2  The Bank Bali scandal involved the illegal transfer of funds from the bank to a company linked to the former ruling Golkar party. \par \par \uc2  Separately, Bank Indonesia Senior Deputy Governor Anwar Nasution said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Deputy Governor, Subarjo Joyosumarto will resign effective July 1. \par \par \uc2  "Subarjo will then take a post as chief of education and training department of the South East Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Association which is based in Kuala Lumpur," Nasution told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Nasution didn't give further details. \par \par \uc2  -By Edhi Pranasidhi; 62 21 3983 1277; epranasidhi@ap.org \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw6c02vko\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
