\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Indonesia - Rupiah Vulnerable To Political Tension \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Mai 2000\par 09:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA-(Dow Jones)- Bank Indonesia Deputy Governor Anwar Nasution said Tuesday the rupiah remained vulnerable to political tensions in the run-up to a special parliament hearing in August at which some lawmakers have threatened to unseat President Abdurrahman Wahid. \par \par \uc2  Anwar said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it was considered necessary and effective to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which recently slumped to a seven-month low against the dollar. Concerns over friction within Wahid's coalition cabinet fueled that drop. \par \par \uc2  "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will still \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market as long as it's considered effective," Anwar told reporters. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't likely to guide interest rates higher in order to help the rupiah, as Indonesian rates are higher than in other countries, he said. \par \par \uc2  The bank's one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia note last Wednesday yielded 10.99%, up from a week-earlier 10.91%. \par \par \uc2  Anwar said that the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should strengthen to 7,500 rupiah to the dollar if the government pushed through reforms agreed with the International Monetary Fund in the latest letter of intent signed last week. \par \par \uc2  At 0745 GMT, the dollar was trading at IDR8,445, up from IDR8,355 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Simon Montlake; 62 21 3983 1277; smontlake@ap.org \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5n02kdu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
